{"id":"demie","lemma":"demie","pos":"noun","rank":3159,"glosses":["semifinal, semi-final"],"ipa":"/də.mi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-demie.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-demie.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"demies"},"formAudio":{"demies":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-demies.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il est trois heures et demie.","en":"It's 3:30.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/472672","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"La pièce dure deux heures et demie.","en":"The play lasts two and a half hours.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room in a house, etc."},{"g":"to last","l":"durer"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"J'attends depuis presque une demie heure.","en":"I've been waiting for almost half an hour.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"almost"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"hour, time"}]},{"text":"J'ai attendu une heure et demie.","en":"I waited an hour and a half.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"awaited, anticipated"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"hour, time"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Le train part à deux heures et demie.","en":"The train leaves at half past two.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"share"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"},{"g":"and"},null]}]}